{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116493","id":3304307626,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7E87uq","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116493","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116493.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116493.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116493","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116493/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116493/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116493/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/2220e21e1b9beddc6f669464690090bd4922d40f","number":116493,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Optimize Projection::determinant()","user":{"login":"hsvfan-jan","id":73224846,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMjI0ODQ2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73224846?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan","html_url":"https://github.com/hsvfan-jan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hsvfan-jan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Revives https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103671\r\n\r\nI just followed Ivorforce's feedback from that PR. It's been years since I did very little C++ so I figured a small PR like this is a good way to start, even if there's little I personally did apart from the revival.\r\n\r\n~~I don't have any setup for C# installed which is why I didn't include the changes beicause asked for.~~ The C# are now included as well, but untested so far.\r\n\r\nGDScript Performance Test (I chose the matrix from [here](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/897172fa25699455f0a537f054654068b3dda5d5/tests/core/math/test_projection.cpp#L99)). n = 30 is often used in statistics as a minimum for normal distribution but I could test with higher n if that's wanted. Note that I didn't actually test for normality, I just calculated average and standard deviation from the results.\r\n```\r\nextends Node\r\n\r\nvar proj := Projection(\r\n\tVector4(1, 5, 9, 13),\r\n\tVector4(2, 6, 11, 15),\r\n\tVector4(4, 7, 11, 15),\r\n\tVector4(4, 8, 12, 16)\r\n)\r\n\t\r\nfunc _ready():\r\n\tfor i in 30:\r\n\t\tvar start := Time.get_ticks_usec()\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\tfor j in 10000000:\r\n\t\t\tvar det : float = proj.determinant()\r\n\t\t\t#print(\"Projection determinant: \", det)\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\tvar end := Time.get_ticks_usec()\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\tvar elapsed := end - start\r\n\t\tprint(\"Elapsed time [micro s] = \", elapsed)\r\n\r\n```\r\nBuilt with `scons platform=macos production=yes debug_symbols=yes tests=yes`\r\n\r\nThis PR: 170324 ± 1872 μs\r\nMaster: 197082 ± 1557 μs\r\n\r\nImprovement roughly 13.6 %. This doesn't come close to https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11821 but I figure that's due to GDScript overhead.\r\n\r\n- *Bugsquad edit:* closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11821","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2790979